1
00:00:01,255 --> 00:00:03,255
Night.

2
00:00:04,879 --> 00:00:06,879
I need to talk to you about Earth.

3
00:00:08,050 --> 00:00:09,000
What about him?

4
00:00:10,384 --> 00:00:12,384
He's been acting weird.

5
00:00:14,006 --> 00:00:14,830
Weird how?

6
00:00:16,304 --> 00:00:18,304
He keeps disappearing at Night.

7
00:00:18,654 --> 00:00:22,775
Comes home late. Says he's “studying,”
which is total bullshit.

8
00:00:22,775 --> 00:00:26,347
And he keeps smelling like cigarettes.

9
00:00:27,249 --> 00:00:30,378
He's a teenage boy, what do you expect.

10
00:00:32,251 --> 00:00:34,910
Whatever. Just call him here.

11
00:00:35,610 --> 00:00:37,610
Yeah, I'll get him.

12
00:00:43,444 --> 00:00:45,444
Is that Earth?

13
00:00:46,231 --> 00:00:48,231
Earth, right? Get over here.

14
00:00:54,188 --> 00:00:54,886
Hurry up.

15
00:01:01,341 --> 00:01:03,341
Tell me what you're doing here.

16
00:01:04,640 --> 00:01:07,660
Gun, can you calm the hell down?

17
00:01:08,082 --> 00:01:09,690
Why is he wearing your shop's uniform?

18
00:01:09,920 --> 00:01:11,010
P'Gun, don't—

19
00:01:11,768 --> 00:01:13,768
Hey! Let me go! Stay out of my business!

20
00:01:14,917 --> 00:01:15,715
What are you doing?!

21
00:01:16,685 --> 00:01:18,685
Calm down, dude.

22
00:01:19,419 --> 00:01:23,066
If you lie to me again, I won't even
consider you my friend anymore, Night.

23
00:01:25,275 --> 00:01:26,177
You hear me?

24
00:01:27,546 --> 00:01:28,636
Earth, let's go.

25
00:01:29,302 --> 00:01:29,828
I'm not going back.

26
00:01:30,706 --> 00:01:33,000
Earth, I said let's go.

27
00:01:34,353 --> 00:01:36,353
You're coming home. Now.

28
00:01:36,533 --> 00:01:37,749
Night, you're so dead for this.
